{"file":"Pencil Underwriting-1.1.0-v1.zip","bytes":43609,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"pencil-underwriting","description":"Underwrite and review commercial real estate in Pencil with five guided workflows and property-specific model guidance.","version":"1.1.0","license":"Proprietary","homepage":"https://pencil.deals"},{"path":".codex-plugin/plugin.json","name":"pencil-underwriting","description":"Underwrite and review commercial real estate in Pencil with five guided workflows and property-specific model guidance.","version":"1.1.0","license":"Proprietary","homepage":"https://pencil.deals"}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/pencil-acquisition/SKILL.md","name":"pencil-acquisition","description":"Underwrite an acquisition in the user's Pencil workspace, reconcile operating assumptions and report current returns, risks and decision inputs for commercial real estate. Use for a Pencil acquisition or buy-box assessment, not public stocks, personal mortgages or finding listings.","headings":["Pencil acquisition"],"name_hint":"pencil · acquisition","description_zh":"在 Pencil 工作区评估商业房地产收购或买入条件，核对经营假设并报告当前收益、风险和决策依据。适用于 Pencil 收购评估，不用于股票、个人房贷或寻找房源。"},{"path":"skills/pencil-capital-structure/SKILL.md","name":"pencil-capital-structure","description":"Analyze or update debt, refinancing, equity classes and waterfalls for a deal in Pencil; distinguish property, levered and investor returns. Use for a Pencil financing or capital-stack task, not personal borrowing, securities trading or generic loan shopping.","headings":["Pencil capital structure"],"name_hint":"pencil · capital · structure","description_zh":"分析或更新 Pencil 交易的债务、再融资、权益类别及分配瀑布，区分物业、杠杆后和投资者收益。适用于融资或资本结构任务，不用于个人借款、证券交易或通用贷款比价。"},{"path":"skills/pencil-development/SKILL.md","name":"pencil-development","description":"Build or review a supported ground-up development model in Pencil, including cost budgets, construction timing, lease-up and stabilization. Use for Pencil development feasibility or a development assumption change; hotel and ground-lease development need separate modeling support.","headings":["Pencil development"],"name_hint":"pencil · development","description_zh":"在 Pencil 中建立或评审受支持的从零开发模型，涵盖成本预算、施工时点、出租爬坡和稳定运营。适用于开发可行性及假设调整；酒店和土地租赁开发需要另行建模支持。"},{"path":"skills/pencil-intake/SKILL.md","name":"pencil-intake","description":"Prepare user-supplied rent rolls, T-12s and property facts for a Pencil commercial real estate deal; reconcile sources and import authorized, deidentified data. Use for Pencil deal setup or intake, not property search or a standalone spreadsheet unrelated to Pencil.","headings":["Pencil intake"],"name_hint":"pencil · intake","description_zh":"整理用户提供的租金明细、T-12 和物业事实，核对来源并导入已授权、去标识化的数据，准备 Pencil 商业房地产交易。适用于交易初始化和材料接入，不用于房源搜索或无关独立表格。"},{"path":"skills/pencil-review/SKILL.md","name":"pencil-review","description":"Audit an existing Pencil commercial real estate model against its sources, reconcile returns and identify material underwriting errors. Use for Pencil model QA, diligence, discrepancy investigation, targeted operating-assumption fixes or an investment-committee review; inspection alone does not authorize repairs.","headings":["Pencil model review"],"name_hint":"pencil · 评审","description_zh":"依据来源审计已有 Pencil 商业房地产模型，核对收益并识别重要评估错误。适用于模型质检、尽调、差异调查、定向经营假设修正或投委会评审；仅要求检查不代表授权修复。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["Pencil Underwriting 1.1.0","Connect to Pencil","What the workflows do","License"]}],"mcp_servers":["pencil"],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".codex-plugin/plugin.json",".mcp.json","LICENSE","README.md","skills/pencil-acquisition/SKILL.md","skills/pencil-acquisition/agents/openai.yaml","skills/pencil-acquisition/references/core.md","skills/pencil-acquisition/references/property-types.md","skills/pencil-acquisition/references/writes.md","skills/pencil-capital-structure/SKILL.md","skills/pencil-capital-structure/agents/openai.yaml","skills/pencil-capital-stru